# The kernel's calls on capabilities (roadmap l4.md L3): every kind of
# object retyped, every refusal, a space built for a new thread from copies,
# moves and a mint, the thread started; a capability that is not a segment,
# loaded into ES, is the program's fault. tests/programs/caps.asm. Without
# extended memory (DOSBox-X) the segment lies in the memory for programs,
# which starts at the image's end (os-server.md P15).
program: caps
define: TEST_CAPS
---
rx286, test build
caps: retype a segment: 0
caps: the segment, zeroed, reads back (4660): 4660
@bochs caps: its base, high byte: 18
@bochs caps: its base, low word: 26512
@mame caps: its base, high byte: 18
@mame caps: its base, low word: 26512
@dosbox-x caps: its base, high byte: {u:27EE0.high}
@dosbox-x caps: its base, low word: {u:27EE0.low}
caps: its limit (255): 255
caps: retype a space: 0
caps: retype a thread: 0
caps: retype an endpoint: 0
caps: retype a notification: 0
caps: retype from a segment (1): 1
caps: retype into a full slot (4): 4
caps: a segment from the arena (0): 0
caps: a thread from the memory for segments (0): 0
caps: a code segment (2): 2
caps: a segment of DPL 0 (2): 2
caps: a space of 12 slots (2): 2
caps: a GDT selector as the untyped (1): 1
caps: a selector past the space (1): 1
caps: an empty slot as the untyped (1): 1
caps: the base of an endpoint (1): 1
caps: a call that does not exist (7): 7
caps: copy its code into the new space: 0
caps: move the segment in, as its data: 0
caps: ES after the move: nulled on the way back (0): 0
caps: retype its stack: 0
caps: move the stack in: 0
caps: mint the endpoint into it, badged: 0
caps: mint a segment (2): 2
caps: mint with no badge (2): 2
caps: copy untyped (2): 2
caps: copy into a full slot (4): 4
caps: copy from an empty slot (1): 1
caps: copy into an endpoint, as a space (1): 1
caps: configure the new thread: 0
caps: start a space, as a thread (1): 1
caps: start at priority 9 (2): 2
caps: start it: 0
caps: start it again (6): 6
caps: configure a running thread: itself (6): 6
caps: load the endpoint into ES
rx286: program fault #GP(0034) at 0007:{entry.load_f}
caps: done
new thread: runs
